ll cards. I have the ♦2 for control in singles, but my pair control is weaker (only KK). Leading the lowest single (♥4) allows the teammate to play if they have singles, or allows me to regain control and switch tactics if they have a pair, maximizing the chance of a team win.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥4"]}'}
